    targetGameObject: {fileID: 5869188558702707082}
    titleComponent: {fileID: 1187546069}
    titleContent: Guide
    textComponent: {fileID: 5193292407794507575}
    textContent: This signal usually comes from a wingwalker standing right at the
      wingtip not always the head marshaller because that's the only person who can
      actually see if the tip will clear an obstacle.
    enableUIPop: 1
    popOrigin: 1
    useTypewriterEffect: 1
    typingSpeed: 0.05
    playVoiceOver: 1
    voiceClips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: c687426ddbde1c94a82dc3590bd2d7b8, type: 3}
    showContinueButtonAfterAudio: 1
    hasQuiz: 1
    quizData:
      questionText: right hand up, left hand down. Which signal did you just see?
      options:
      - optionText: "Guide \n\n"
        isCorrect: 1
      - optionText: ' Identify Gate'
        isCorrect: 0
      - optionText: ' Normal Stop'
        isCorrect: 0
      - optionText: Chocks Inserted
        isCorrect: 0
      correctTitle: Nice
      wrongTitle: Close
      correctExplanation: ' that one stuck.'
      wrongExplanation: worth a rewatch before we move on.
    objectsToHideOnQuiz:
    - {fileID: 991408247}
    objectsToShowOnQuiz: []
    onAllVoiceClipsEnded:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onSingleVoiceClipEnded:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - pageLabel: Scene 2
    targetGameObject: {fileID: 5869188558702707082}
    titleComponent: {fileID: 1187546069}
    titleContent: 'Identify Gate '
    textComponent: {fileID: 5193292407794507575}
    textContent: "On a busy apron with several marshallers working at once, this
      is the signal that cuts through the noise and says \u201Cover here.\u201D"
    enableUIPop: 1
    popOrigin: 1
    useTypewriterEffect: 1
    typingSpeed: 0.05
    playVoiceOver: 1
    voiceClips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: a39023898a9e48944b686ebb3383edab, type: 3}
    showContinueButtonAfterAudio: 1
    hasQuiz: 1
    quizData:
      questionText: ' Both arms fully extended straight up, wands pointing to the
        sky. Which signal did you just see?'
      options:
      - optionText: "Guide \n\n"
        isCorrect: 0
      - optionText: ' Normal Stop'
        isCorrect: 0
      - optionText: Chocks Out
        isCorrect: 0
      - optionText: ' Identify Gate'
        isCorrect: 1
      correctTitle: Nice
      wrongTitle: Close
      correctExplanation: ' that one stuck.'
      wrongExplanation: worth a rewatch before we move on.
    objectsToHideOnQuiz:
    - {fileID: 991408247}
    objectsToShowOnQuiz: []
    onAllVoiceClipsEnded:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onSingleVoiceClipEnded:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - pageLabel: Scene 3
    targetGameObject: {fileID: 5869188558702707082}
    titleComponent: {fileID: 1187546069}
    titleContent: 'Turn Left '
    textComponent: {fileID: 5193292407794507575}
    textContent: "\u201CLeft\u201D and \u201Cright\u201D in these signals are always
      described from the pilot's point of view, not the signalman's  worth calling
      out clearly on screen so learners don't mirror it by mistake."
    enableUIPop: 1
    popOrigin: 1
    useTypewriterEffect: 1
    typingSpeed: 0.05
    playVoiceOver: 1
    voiceClips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: c5202eaf462def0458822ed9b21c49ea, type: 3}
    showContinueButtonAfterAudio: 1
    hasQuiz: 1
    quizData:
      questionText: ' Both arms fully extended straight up, wands pointing to the
        sky. Which signal did you just see?'
      options:
      - optionText: 'Straight Ahead '
        isCorrect: 0
      - optionText: Turn Left
        isCorrect: 1
      - optionText: Turn Right
        isCorrect: 0
      - optionText: Normal Stop
        isCorrect: 0
      correctTitle: Nice
      wrongTitle: Close
      correctExplanation: ' that one stuck.'
      wrongExplanation: worth a rewatch before we move on.
    objectsToHideOnQuiz:
    - {fileID: 991408247}
    objectsToShowOnQuiz: []
    onAllVoiceClipsEnded:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onSingleVoiceClipEnded:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - pageLabel: Scene 4
    targetGameObject: {fileID: 5869188558702707082}
    titleComponent: {fileID: 1187546069}
    titleContent: Turn Right
    textComponent: {fileID: 5193292407794507575}
    textContent: "Turn Left and Turn Right share the same extended arm, learners
      often mix them up \u2014 this is a great spot for a side-by-side comparison
      card in the library."
    enableUIPop: 1
    popOrigin: 1
    useTypewriterEffect: 1
    typingSpeed: 0.05
    playVoiceOver: 1
    voiceClips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 924db54d7e6287e47a43b34179bdbfd9, type: 3}
    showContinueButtonAfterAudio: 1
    hasQuiz: 1
    quizData:
      questionText: "right arm out at 90\xB0, right hand beckoning \u201Ccome ahead.\u201D
        Which signal did you just see?"
      options:
      - optionText: Turn Right
        isCorrect: 1
      - optionText: 'Straight Ahead '
        isCorrect: 0
      - optionText: Turn Left
        isCorrect: 0
      - optionText: Engine Start
        isCorrect: 0
      correctTitle: Nice
      wrongTitle: Close
      correctExplanation: ' that one stuck.'
      wrongExplanation: worth a rewatch before we move on.
    objectsToHideOnQuiz:
    - {fileID: 412317246}
    objectsToShowOnQuiz: []
    onAllVoiceClipsEnded:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onSingleVoiceClipEnded:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - pageLabel: Scene 5
    targetGameObject: {fileID: 5869188558702707082}
    titleComponent: {fileID: 1187546069}
    titleContent: 'Straight Ahead '
    textComponent: {fileID: 5193292407794507575}
    textContent: "This is one of the \u201Ccontinuous\u201D signals it doesn't mean
      anything as a single freeze-frame, the repetition is the message."
    enableUIPop: 1
    popOrigin: 1
    useTypewriterEffect: 1
    typingSpeed: 0.05
    playVoiceOver: 1
    voiceClips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 68b9fd689809d0b4681896be8b10b50e, type: 3}
    showContinueButtonAfterAudio: 1
    hasQuiz: 1
    quizData:
      questionText: Elbows bent, wands pumping from chest height to head. Which signal
        did you just see?
      options:
      - optionText: Normal Stop
        isCorrect: 0
      - optionText: Turn Left
        isCorrect: 0
      - optionText: 'Straight Ahead '
        isCorrect: 1
      - optionText: Engine Start
        isCorrect: 0
      correctTitle: Nice
      wrongTitle: Close
      correctExplanation: ' that one stuck.'
      wrongExplanation: worth a rewatch before we move on.
    objectsToHideOnQuiz: []
    objectsToShowOnQuiz: []
    onAllVoiceClipsEnded:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onSingleVoiceClipEnded:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - pageLabel: Scene 6
    targetGameObject: {fileID: 5869188558702707082}
    titleComponent: {fileID: 1187546069}
    titleContent: Normal Stop
    textComponent: {fileID: 5193292407794507575}
    textContent: 'Watch the pace on screen: a slow, controlled sweep is what separates
      a routine stop from an emergency one'
    enableUIPop: 1
    popOrigin: 1
    useTypewriterEffect: 1
    typingSpeed: 0.05
    playVoiceOver: 1
    voiceClips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 86fc3839da2357741ad7c8b4d730c397, type: 3}
    showContinueButtonAfterAudio: 1
    hasQuiz: 1
    quizData:
      questionText: Arms sweeping slowly up until the wands cross overhead. Which
        signal did you just see?
      options:
      - optionText: Chock Inserted
        isCorrect: 0
      - optionText: Normal Stop
        isCorrect: 1
      - optionText: 'Straight Ahead '
        isCorrect: 0
      - optionText: Guide
        isCorrect: 0
      correctTitle: Nice
      wrongTitle: Close
      correctExplanation: ' that one stuck.'
      wrongExplanation: worth a rewatch before we move on.
    objectsToHideOnQuiz: []
    objectsToShowOnQuiz: []
    onAllVoiceClipsEnded:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onSingleVoiceClipEnded:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - pageLabel: Scene 7
    targetGameObject: {fileID: 5869188558702707082}
    titleComponent: {fileID: 1187546069}
    titleContent: 'Chocks Inserted '
    textComponent: {fileID: 5193292407794507575}
    textContent: This is one of the signals with a built-in checkpoint  a great place
      for an on-screen WARNING if the learner tries to skip ahead without the acknowledgment
    enableUIPop: 1
    popOrigin: 1
    useTypewriterEffect: 1
    typingSpeed: 0.05
    playVoiceOver: 1
    voiceClips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: a8319afa77d28f049a453c5fdde69ef4, type: 3}
    showContinueButtonAfterAudio: 0
    hasQuiz: 1
    quizData:
      questionText: Arms up, wands jabbing inward until they touch. Which signal
        did you just see?
      options:
      - optionText: Normal Stop
        isCorrect: 0
      - optionText: Engine Start
        isCorrect: 0
      - optionText: Chock Out
        isCorrect: 0
      - optionText: Chock Inserted
        isCorrect: 1
      correctTitle: Nice
      wrongTitle: Close
      correctExplanation: ' that one stuck.'
      wrongExplanation: worth a rewatch before we move on.
    objectsToHideOnQuiz:
    - {fileID: 161519747}
    objectsToShowOnQuiz: []
    onAllVoiceClipsEnded:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onSingleVoiceClipEnded:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - pageLabel: Scene 8
    targetGameObject: {fileID: 5869188558702707082}
    titleComponent: {fileID: 1187546069}
    titleContent: Engine Cut
    textComponent: {fileID: 5193292407794507575}
    textContent: It looks dramatic, but that's exactly the point  a signal meant
      to be unmistakable at a distance, even through engine noise
    enableUIPop: 1
    popOrigin: 1
    useTypewriterEffect: 1
    typingSpeed: 0.05
    playVoiceOver: 1
    voiceClips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6ae67320c680dd24794b435b00fd4760, type: 3}
    showContinueButtonAfterAudio: 1
    hasQuiz: 1
    quizData:
      questionText: wand slicing across the throat, shoulder to shoulder. Which signal
        did you just see?
      options:
      - optionText: Engine Cut
        isCorrect: 1
      - optionText: Normal Stop
        isCorrect: 0
      - optionText: Engine Start
        isCorrect: 0
      - optionText: Chock Inserted
        isCorrect: 0
      correctTitle: Nice
      wrongTitle: Close
      correctExplanation: ' that one stuck.'
      wrongExplanation: worth a rewatch before we move on.
    objectsToHideOnQuiz:
    - {fileID: 1854421477}
    objectsToShowOnQuiz: []
    onAllVoiceClipsEnded:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onSingleVoiceClipEnded:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - pageLabel: Scene 9
    targetGameObject: {fileID: 5869188558702707082}
    titleComponent: {fileID: 1187546069}
    titleContent: 'Chock Out '
    textComponent: {fileID: 5193292407794507575}
    textContent: "In means in, out means out the direction of the jab is the whole
      difference between these two signals, so it's worth animating them back-to-back
      for comparison.\t\t"
    enableUIPop: 1
    popOrigin: 1
    useTypewriterEffect: 1
    typingSpeed: 0.05
    playVoiceOver: 1
    voiceClips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9f11e94f45a649b439faf4fdb7b79753, type: 3}
    showContinueButtonAfterAudio: 0
    hasQuiz: 1
    quizData:
      questionText: Arms up, wands jabbing outward this time, not in. Which signal
        did you just see?
      options:
      - optionText: Identify Gate
        isCorrect: 0
      - optionText: Engine Start
        isCorrect: 0
      - optionText: 'Chock Out '
        isCorrect: 1
      - optionText: Chock Inserted
        isCorrect: 0
      correctTitle: Nice
      wrongTitle: Close
      correctExplanation: ' that one stuck.'
      wrongExplanation: worth a rewatch before we move on.
    objectsToHideOnQuiz:
    - {fileID: 161519747}
    objectsToShowOnQuiz: []
    onAllVoiceClipsEnded:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onSingleVoiceClipEnded:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - pageLabel: Scene 10
    targetGameObject: {fileID: 5869188558702707082}
    titleComponent: {fileID: 1187546069}
    titleContent: Engine Start
    textComponent: {fileID: 5193292407794507575}
    textContent: 'This is the signal where the engine numbering rule from Section
      2 actually gets used  a good spot to remind learners: engine No. 1 is the port
      outer engine.'
    enableUIPop: 1
    popOrigin: 1
    useTypewriterEffect: 1
